         <dc:format>image/epsf</dc:format>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">File - (AP) Black Mercedes used to fool Uganda soldiers in Israeli raid on Entebbe parked aboard Israeli transport plane upon return from July 4 operation: Never-before published photo is in Book about raid written by Israeli Journalist. (AP-Photo) 10.12.1976</rdf:li>
