         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">East German border guards look through a hole in the Berlin wall after demonstrators pulled down one segment of the wall at Brandenburg gate Saturday, November 11, 1989.  (AP Photo/Lionel Cironneau)</rdf:li>
